00:21:55,689 --> 00:21:58,567
My future husband
will never see my boobs at their best.

475
00:21:58,650 --> 00:21:59,860
[sighs]

476
00:22:02,070 --> 00:22:03,322
I'm just, like, bummed out now.

477
00:22:03,405 --> 00:22:06,325
-Yeah, I feel really sad.
-Yeah, me too. [sighs]

478
00:22:06,408 --> 00:22:08,619
-Hey!
-Hey.

479
00:22:08,702 --> 00:22:09,995
Finally ran into you.

480
00:22:11,037 --> 00:22:12,038
[sighs]

481
00:22:12,873 --> 00:22:14,290
What's up?
What's going on?

482
00:22:14,375 --> 00:22:16,627
I'm feeling a little wiped out.

483
00:22:16,710 --> 00:22:18,128
Thanks for inviting me, Gus.

484
00:22:20,005 --> 00:22:21,089
Great party.

485
00:22:31,224 --> 00:22:32,225
Hi.

486
00:22:33,101 --> 00:22:34,853
-Hey.
-So...

487
00:22:36,021 --> 00:22:37,689
I know what you and Dr. Greg talked about.

488
00:22:37,773 --> 00:22:38,857
Oh.

489
00:22:39,441 --> 00:22:41,026
That wasn't my finest hour.

490
00:22:41,109 --> 00:22:45,196
But you and I weren't even dating then,
so I don't get why you're mad at me.

491
00:22:46,490 --> 00:22:52,746
'Cause he said, like, everything I'm,
like, worried might be true. I don't know.

492
00:22:52,829 --> 00:22:54,831
What? What... what did he say to you?

493
00:22:55,957 --> 00:22:58,960
He said you didn't really like me,
and that... [takes deep breath]

494
00:22:59,044 --> 00:23:00,796
you were just using me, and that...

495
00:23:01,880 --> 00:23:04,132
what we had wasn't special.

496
00:23:04,215 --> 00:23:05,926
-What?
-I mean, is that true?

497
00:23:06,009 --> 00:23:08,595
No, it's not true.
Why would you listen to him, anyway?

498
00:23:08,679 --> 00:23:11,723
He's not a real doctor.
He's like Dr. Phil.

499
00:23:11,807 --> 00:23:15,226
-Dr. Phil's not a real doctor?
-Whatever. That's beside the point.

500
00:23:15,310 --> 00:23:16,895
Dr. Greg isn't my therapist.

501
00:23:16,978 --> 00:23:19,690
I haven't, like, told him
my deepest, darkest secrets.

502
00:23:20,273 --> 00:23:23,151
He's an asshole anyway,
and he's jealous, okay?

503
00:23:23,234 --> 00:23:24,986
[stammers] He's...

504
00:23:26,488 --> 00:23:27,864
Fuck that guy!

505
00:23:28,657 --> 00:23:29,741
Yeah.

506
00:23:42,379 --> 00:23:44,631
Do you wanna just, like,
dance or something?

507
00:23:46,508 --> 00:23:47,509
-Come on.
-Okay.

508
00:23:47,593 --> 00:23:48,677
Let's do it.

509
00:23:52,180 --> 00:23:54,015
[upbeat music playing]

